#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:112
msgid "<interface>Header &amp; Footer Font</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Teckensnitt för sidhuvud och sidfot</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:128
msgid "Copy and Paste Preferences"
msgstr "Inställningar för kopiering och inklistring"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:131
msgid ""
"The <interface>Copy and Paste</interface> element allows the user to "
"determine how copied items are integrated into the clipboard mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <interface>Kopiera och klistra in</interface> anger du hur "
"kopierade objekt hanteras i urklippet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:138
msgid "<interface>Copy and Paste</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Kopiera och klistra in</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:153
msgid "File Preferences"
msgstr "Filinställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:155
msgid ""
"The <interface>Files</interface> element provides settings related to the "
"handling of files."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <interface>Filer</interface> innehåller inställningar för "
"filhantering."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:161
msgid "<interface>Files</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Filer</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:171
msgid "The number of recently used files"
msgstr "Antal senast använda filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:172
msgid ""
"If you are usually using one of a small number of documents, you should set "
"the <interface>Length of File History</interface> to be slightly larger than"
" the number of these documents."
msgstr ""
"Om du oftast arbetar med ett litet antal dokument bör du ställa in "
"<interface>Historikens längd</interface> på ett värde som är något större än"
" antalet dokument."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:187
msgid "Tools Preferences"
msgstr "Verktygsinställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:190
msgid ""
"The <interface>Tools</interface> element allows to determine the settings "
"for the recently used function list, for autocompletion of data entry in "
"cells and for range selections."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <interface>Verktyg</interface> anger du inställningar för "
"listan över senast använda funktioner, automatisk komplettering av celldata "
"och områdesmarkeringar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:197
msgid "<interface>Tools</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Verktyg</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:206
msgid ""
"The <interface>Sorting</interface> element allows to determine the default "
"settings for the <interface>Sort Dialog</interface>."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <interface>Sortering</interface> anger du "
"standardinställningarna för <interface>Sorteringsdialogrutan</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:212
msgid "<interface>Sorting</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Sortering</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:228
msgid "Undo History Preferences"
msgstr "Inställningar för ångrahistorik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:230
msgid ""
"The <interface>Undo</interface> element permits to customize the undo "
"feature. You would normally like the number of undo items to be in the 10 to"
" 25 range and the maximal undo size to be 10000 to 100000, unless you only "
"have little memory available."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <interface>Ångra</interface> anpassar du ångrafunktionen. "
"Vanligtvis räcker det med 10–25 åtgärder i ångrahistoriken och en maximal "
"storlek på 10 000–100 000, om du inte har ont om minne."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:238
msgid "<interface>Undo</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Ångra</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:254
msgid "Windows Preferences"
msgstr "Fönsterinställningar"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:256
msgid ""
"The windows preferences include options to set the default appearance of the"
" whole window displaying the <application>Gnumeric</application> interface "
"as well as"
msgstr ""
"Fönsterinställningarna innehåller alternativ för standardutseendet på hela "
"fönstret med <application>Gnumeric</application>-gränssnittet samt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:262
msgid ""
"The <interface>Windows</interface> element includes a variety of options "
"that did not fit within any of the other tabs."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <interface>Fönster</interface> innehåller flera inställningar "
"som inte passar in på någon av de andra flikarna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:268
msgid "<interface>Windows</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fönster</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:277
msgid ""
"The <interface>Screen</interface> elements allows the user to set the pixel "
"pitch (number of pixels per length) for the screen. This is a fundamental "
"property of the display which should be set correctly by default."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <interface>Skärm</interface> anger du bildpunktstätheten "
"(antalet pixlar per längdenhet). Det här är en grundläggande egenskap hos "
"skärmen och bör normalt redan vara rätt inställd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:285
msgid "<interface>Screen</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Skärm</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:295
msgid "The pixel pitch is fundamental"
msgstr "Bildpunktstätheten är grundläggande"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:297
msgid ""
"These options affect the display of <application>Gnumeric</application> and "
"should only be changed after serious consideration. By default these options"
" should be correct and should only be altered for non-standard screens and "
"when the appearance of <application>Gnumeric</application> and its contents "
"are clearly incorrect."
msgstr ""
"Dessa alternativ påverkar visningen i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"och bör bara ändras efter noggrant övervägande. Som standard ska de vara "
"rätt inställda. Ändra dem bara för skärmar som avviker från standard eller "
"om utseendet på <application>Gnumeric</application> och dess innehåll "
"uppenbart är fel."
